    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37406" root="كيس" body-key="k">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَيْسَانُ</span></b>  (tropical:)  a proper name for <i>Perfidy;</i> (IAar,
S, A, K;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبُو كَيْسَانَ</span>: (IAar:) of the
dial. of Teiyi: and derived from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَيْسٌ</span>. (Kr.)
You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَكِبَ كَيْسَانَ</span> (tropical:)  <i>He acted perfidiously.</i>
(A.)

